{"id":"en_no-more-chances","title":"No More Chances","titleEn":"No More Chances","description":"For ten years, Amy Carter believed she was simply the wife of William Harrington, unaware of the fortune he kept hidden. That illusion ends when his former love reappears. William turns on Amy and their daughter, shaming them openly and leaving his injured child behind to tend to another woman's dog. Amy leaves with only her daughter, but she is not without allies. Friends of her late father have spent a decade looking for her, and they bring with them a powerful dynasty. With her heart closed off, the woman William once discarded returns to settle accounts, and he discovers that not every opportunity is offered twice.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-more-chances/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-more-chances/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsypm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_no-more-chances_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsypm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-more-chances_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsypm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-more-chances_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsypm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-more-chances_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsypm/?pub=4occak","kind":"em